me.\n\nPlayers lead a customizable party of up to six characters through labyrinths filled with traps, treasure, and monsters. Recruits can belong to different races and classes, with age affecting their starting attributes and life points. The game emphasizes equipment collection, character development, and hunting powerful monsters known as Lineage Types. Blood Crystals recovered from these enemies can be entrusted to the leaders of three factions, with the player's choices shaping the story and its ending.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/stranger-of-sword-city", "videos": [{"id": 7891, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "_DZNdT9sUo0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_DZNdT9sUo0", "title": "Stranger of Sword City - Official Story Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_DZNdT9sUo0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 7948, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "NClBl-hVoss", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NClBl-hVoss", "title": "Stranger of Sword City - Official Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NClBl-hVoss/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 7949, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "EXP7ZmrO3Qs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EXP7ZmrO3Qs", "title": "STRANGER OF SWORD CITY - Xbox One - Official Trailer 2 - Classic Style", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EXP7ZmrO3Qs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 7950, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "0cAqhta0G7Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0cAqhta0G7Y", "title": "STRANGER OF SWORD CITY - Xbox One - Official Trailer 2 - New Style", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0cAqhta0G7Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "game_localizations": [{"id": 5524, "name": "\u5263\u306e\u8857\u306e\u7570\u90a6\u4eba \u767d\u306e\u738b\u5bae", "cover": {"id": 566460, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/coc530.jpg"}, "region": {"id": 3, "name": "Japan", "category": "locale", "identifier": "ja-JP"}}], "collections": [{"id": 13707, "name": "Stranger of Sword City"}]}